        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do I need an e‑Way bill for moving my household goods from Dewas to Delhi?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Under GST regulations, any inter‑state transport of goods exceeding the prescribed value requires an e‑Way bill. Shree Ashirwad’s logistics team prepares the e‑Way bill on your behalf, linking it to the GSTIN on the invoice. This ensures smooth customs clearance at state borders, avoids penalties, and speeds up the claim process for corporate or government reimbursements.</p>
